 "comment": "Pinned tuning data for plan step 6 (tools/tuner/data.py). Each source is either 'train' (the tuner searches presets on it) or 'valid' (a preset or sub-profile is accepted only on it), so the two never share a project; the benchmark test set (tools/harness) uses other projects again, and data.py also drops any file whose content is in the harness set. Files are filtered for primer overlap like the test set. Tuning data only decides settings; it is never shipped, never used to build primers or minds.",
